# TURNIP TRUCK: THE BIG BEET. A giant beetroot charges at the truck when it
# can see it, faster than the truck for a moment; a touch costs a heart and
# it bounces off. Out of sight it rolls along the streets after you, slower
# than the truck; it never goes through a building.
seed 6
game turnip
wait 5
cheat day 3 2
cheat notraffic
expect beets == 1
cheat clearmobs
cheat pos 400 264
cheat stop
cheat mob 0 520 264
wait 2
expect mob0_state == 1
waituntil hit_by3 >= 1 100
expect hearts == 2
expect mob0_state == 0
# behind the buildings: it rolls round by the streets
cheat clearmobs
cheat hearts 3
cheat inv 0
cheat mob 0 168 120
wait 5
expect mob0_state == 2
wait 30
expect mob0_solid == 0
wait 30
expect mob0_solid == 0
waituntil mob0_dist < 150 600
expect mob0_solid == 0
